        <span id="spotlight-text">Take a peek into one of Holmes’ 85 programs of study. Ranging from Culinary Arts to
          Welding, we truly have something for everyone. Looking for a deeper dive into a program not listed here? Just
          request information, and we’ll send it.</span>
